Package: fortuneCougar
Title: fortuneCougar: A Social Casino Built as a Shiny Package
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: 
    person("First", "Last", , "first.last@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A modular R Shiny social-casino app (play money only): 22 feature
    slot machines (classic, mythological and animal 3D themes), Blackjack
    (Classic, European, Switch, Perfect Pairs), Video Poker (Jacks or Better,
    Deuces Wild, Bonus, Joker Poker) and Roulette (European, American, French,
    Multi-Wheel), plus a metagame (card album with Lucky Cards, Wheel of Fun,
    Star Market, Monsterpedia, loyalty tiers and Daily Dash missions) sharing
    one reactive player session. Progress and the linked jackpots persist in an
    SQLite database; the interface is available in English and Brazilian
    Portuguese.
License: `use_mit_license()`, `use_gpl3_license()` or friends to pick a
    license
